  "family": "cryogen-free dilution refrigerator measurement system",
  "description": "Pulse-tube-precooled, closed-cycle He-3/He-4 dilution refrigerator with a 294 mm mixing-chamber flange (current page). Bluefors renamed the LD250 to LD350 and the LD400 / LD400sl to LD450 / LD450sl on 2026-03-10 and raised the guaranteed cooling-power figures (ev_bf_0001). Original LD250/LD400 figures come from the Bluefors User Manual LD System v2.0 (2022); LD450 figures come from bluefors.com in 2026. Wiring, magnets, optical access and sample holders are options; the standard system has no documented wiring count.",
